- Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com), from ECMWF ERA5 reanalysis: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.
  Weather data by Open-Meteo.com.

Used internally, never exported or committed:
- The Ultimate Ball-by-Ball Cricket Dataset by Ari Adaikalam, with tracking from ESPNcricinfo
  (https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ariadaikalam/the-ultimate-ball-by-ball-cricket-dataset). Its Cricinfo-derived
  parts are shared for non-commercial use with credit to ESPNcricinfo, under Cricinfo's terms.
- Hawk-Eye ball-tracking via alittlefitness/HawkeyeStats (https://github.com/alittlefitness/HawkeyeStats).
  No licence stated.

Test fixture (tests/fixtures/tiny): open data for 10 matches from the sources above, under their licences, plus
SYNTHETIC stand-ins for the two restricted sources (generated by scripts/make_fixture.py; no real values).

